# Monarch project map

## Products in one repo

| Area | Path | Hosting |
|------|------|---------|
| **PHI referral app** (local dev + Vercel) | `apps/referral-app/` | Staging: `https://monarch-two-theta.vercel.app` |
| **Framer code (Competency, legacy flat)** | `Code/Framer/*.tsx` | Marketing: `https://www.monarchcompetency.com` |
| **Framer code (by brand)** | `Code/Framer/{competency,mental-health,sober-living,shared}/` | Separate `www` domains per brand |
| **Supabase** | `supabase/migrations/` | Shared backend (program-scoped later) |

Brand map and edit rules: see `multi-brand` rule.

**Local PHI dev:** `npm run dev` from repo root → `apps/referral-app` on **port 5173**.  
Do **not** use `npm run dev:ui` for the real app (playground also wants 5173).

## PHI app routes (`apps/referral-app/src/App.tsx`)

| Path | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `/` | Dev route shell (not production marketing home) |
| `/login`, `/admin` | `AuthGateway` (partner vs staff) |
| `/portal` | `ReferralSourcePortal` |
| `/dashboard` | `ReferralDashboard` |
| `/submit-referrals`, `/submit-referrals/documents` | Forms |
| `/r?token=` | ROI share link |

Marketing `/referrals` on Framer is **not** the same as local `localhost:5173/`.

## Auth buckets (technical vs UI copy)

- **Bucket IDs:** `"source"` (partners) and `"staff"` — storage keys `sb-{ref}-auth-source` / `sb-{ref}-auth-staff`.
- **UI copy** may say "referral partner" — that is correct. **Never bulk-rename `partner` → `source`** across the codebase.

Staff and partner sessions on one origin: use **separate browsers** if sessions conflict locally.

## Env

- Client vars: `VITE_SUPABASE_URL`, `VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY` in repo `.env` and/or `apps/referral-app/.env.local` (app wins).
- **Never commit** `.env`, `.env.local`, or secrets.

